Projects/UOContent/Engines/Pathing/Cache/StepProbe.cs

Adds StepProbe.ComputeStandableSurfaceZsWithMultis: the standable surfaces of a cell with house and boat components
counted as candidate surfaces, beside the existing static-only ComputeStandableSurfaceZs (which now shares its body).
The tiered navigation in Projects/UOContent/Engines/Pathing/Tiered draws the clusters a multi touches with it.
Without this patch the tiered navigation does not compile.

WHY. Patrick's order of 26.09.2026: implement the tiers of path search (short, medium, long). A floor of a house is a
standable surface a walker steps onto, and the static probe does not see it.

